<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 54,100 MT were nearly four times the previous week and one-fifth over the 4-week average.  Mexico (53,700 MT) was the major buyer.</p>
<p>Sales of 37,500 MT for delivery in 1997/98 were for Mexico (29,500 MT) and Japan (8,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 97,600 MT were 89 percent above the prior week and three and two-fifths times the 4-week average.  The primary destinations were Mexico (49,000 MT), Israel (31,400 MT), and Japan (16,900 MT).</p>
</text>
